///
/// Defaults to true, in which case the drawer will close upon the user tapping on the barrier.␀ÀğÀü‚
ÀğÁ/// If true, and an [appBar] is specified, then the height of the [body] is
/// extended to include the height of the app bar and the top of the body
/// is aligned with the top of the app bar.
