///
/// Defaults to [AlignmentDirectional.centerEnd].␀À#¯À"␀ÉÀ#¯~/// Decoration for the container that holds the [persistentFooterButtons].
///
/// By default, this container has a top border with a width of 1.0, created by
/// [Divider.createBorderSide].
///
/// See also:
